{"unit_id":"dongdonga11__dsh-customer-service#feature-feature-1","repo":"dongdonga11/dsh-customer-service","commit":"eb572f0bd91f6f02109cd304b19d3abc4d966315","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Customer Service 的功能「统一消息工作台」：该功能把闲鱼和抖音扩展连接到 DSH 本地桥，并在侧栏展示账号与客服对话。扩展连接平台页面后，用户可在面板查看会话并人工回复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:162-180","lib/client.js:1842-1856"]}
{"unit_id":"dongdonga11__dsh-customer-service#feature-feature-2","repo":"dongdonga11/dsh-customer-service","commit":"eb572f0bd91f6f02109cd304b19d3abc4d966315","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Customer Service 的功能「AI 客服回复」：该功能可用 DSH 已配置的模型生成客服回复，并结合店铺资料；运行时包含发送前复查与审计路径。AI 总开关默认为关闭，可从面板设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/kernel/config.js:93-96","lib/kernel/ai.js:334-371"]}
{"unit_id":"dongdonga11__dsh-customer-service#feature-feature-3","repo":"dongdonga11/dsh-customer-service","commit":"eb572f0bd91f6f02109cd304b19d3abc4d966315","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Customer Service 的功能「项目知识库」：该功能将资料按项目组织并绑定客服账号，支持维护 Markdown 文档并供回复流程检索。适合把产品信息、店规和话术集中供客服使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:142-154","lib/kernel/library.js:103-145"]}
{"unit_id":"dongdonga11__dsh-customer-service#feature-feature-4","repo":"dongdonga11/dsh-customer-service","commit":"eb572f0bd91f6f02109cd304b19d3abc4d966315","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Customer Service 的功能「闲鱼商品与订单工具」：Agent 可调用闲鱼工具查询连接、订单和商品，也能管理产品、客户档案及采集内容；工具由适配器构建并注册到 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:42-45","lib/index.js:307-328","lib/platforms/xianyu/tools.js:101-126"]}
{"unit_id":"dongdonga11__dsh-customer-service#feature-feature-5","repo":"dongdonga11/dsh-customer-service","commit":"eb572f0bd91f6f02109cd304b19d3abc4d966315","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Customer Service 的功能「闲鱼付款自动交付」：为商品启用自动交付并设置交付内容后，付款触发事件会将内容发送给对应买家并记录出站消息。此功能只在商品配置已启用且有交付内容时执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/platforms/xianyu/auto_deliver.js:28-55"]}
